# PR workflow

- Implement each phase on `phase-N-<name>`, never commit phase work directly to `master`.
- Open a PR when the phase is feature-complete so `/review-bugbot` and `/review-security` compare against `master`.
- Do not merge until the user has run the required `/` reviews (or explicitly skipped them).
